name: Shared native limits, exact three-pass approval, partial triage and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/map-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: map
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | imported-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
submit: campaign owned-secret-settings
require-live-snap: 25 owned-secret-settings | unapproved-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study-form
keys: Down Down Down Tab Tab z Home
require-live-snap: 15 PREPARED SETTINGS | settings-120x36
resize: 160x48
live-snap: settings-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: settings-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: settings-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: settings-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: settings-page-0
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-8
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-9
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-10
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-11
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-12
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-13
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-14
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-15
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-16
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-17
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-18
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-19
keys: NPage
live-snap: settings-page-20
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART settings
ask: Are the four exact native limits and their current descriptor help readable before approval, with no job or provider work started?
resize: 120x36
keys: z Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-call-editor
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | review-call-editor
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | allowance-review
expect: Total provider calls: 1
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 failed | exhausted-partial-jobs
ask: Do three fixed partial attempts retain their observed signals, accepted file membership and original limits without retries or allowance expansion?
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | partial-result
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 partial acknowledged | acknowledged-partial
keys: Escape
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | partial-observation-list
expect: F-0001
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 signal-only | signal-review
resize: 160x48
live-snap: partial-review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: partial-review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: partial-review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: partial-review-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: partial-review-40x12
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 15 F-0001 | partial-review-restored
expect: FINDINGS · 1
ask: Does the partial finding appear in the study-filtered list and open with Enter, while completed-pass recurrence remains zero?
keys: Escape
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned public example is not an active credential
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public example | human-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope: study owned-secret-settings | report
keys: j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the actual export preserve the human decision, exact study and partial coverage, with zero provider requests and unchanged source?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | restarted-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public example | restarted-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/secret_settings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the same partial attempts, observations and human decision without another scan or request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
